 69429                           ;	PR1WAY = ON, PRLOCKED bit can be cleared and set only once
 69430                           ;	Clock Switch Enable bit
 69431                           ;	CSWEN = ON, Writing to NOSC and NDIV is allowed
 69432                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor Enable bit
